# Generated by `expo prebuild` (Continuous Native Generation) and never edited by
# hand. The only hand-written native code is modules/health-write/ios/, which is
# tracked; the HealthKit entitlement and usage string come from its config plugin.
# If you find yourself wanting to edit ios/, the change belongs in app.json or a
# config plugin instead — otherwise the next `prebuild --clean` erases it.
/ios
/android
